<main class="pc" data-product-core="potential"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 03 / Potential</p><h1>Null ist nicht das Ziel.</h1><p class="pc-lead">Das Potenzial wird individuell untersucht, nicht aus der Differenz berechnet.</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/" aria-current="page">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><p>Persönliche Zufriedenheit: 0 = gar nicht, 10 = vollständig. Keine klinische Skala.</p><div class="pc-grid"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Körperlich</p><h3>Bewegung und Komfort</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-0">Aktuell</label><select id="pc-current-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Nicht bewertet</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-0">Gewünscht</label><select id="pc-desired-0" data-axis="physical" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Nicht bewertet</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potenzial</span><div class="pc-unknown">Nicht bestimmt</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Kognitiv</p><h3>Aufmerksamkeit</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-1">Aktuell</label><select id="pc-current-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Nicht bewertet</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-1">Gewünscht</label><select id="pc-desired-1" data-axis="cognitive" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Nicht bewertet</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potenzial</span><div class="pc-unknown">Nicht bestimmt</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Emotional</p><h3>Ruhe und Leichtigkeit</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-2">Aktuell</label><select id="pc-current-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Nicht bewertet</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-2">Gewünscht</label><select id="pc-desired-2" data-axis="emotional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Nicht bewertet</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potenzial</span><div class="pc-unknown">Nicht bestimmt</div></div></div></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Beruflich</p><h3>Ressourcen im Arbeitsalltag</h3><div class="pc-state"><div><label for="pc-current-3">Aktuell</label><select id="pc-current-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="current"><option value="">— Nicht bewertet</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><label for="pc-desired-3">Gewünscht</label><select id="pc-desired-3" data-axis="professional" data-rating="desired"><option value="">— Nicht bewertet</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7</option><option value="8">8</option><option value="9">9</option><option value="10">10</option></select></div><div><span class="pc-state-title">Potenzial</span><div class="pc-unknown">Nicht bestimmt</div></div></div></div></div><p class="pc-note">Das Potenzial wird individuell untersucht, nicht aus der Differenz berechnet.</p><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>Zurücksetzen</button><button type="button" data-save data-js hidden>Auf Gerät speichern</button></div><p class="pc-note">Keine automatische Übertragung; Export als lokale JSON-Datei.</p></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">Anliegen besprechen</a></div></section></main>